// candidate-floor-run.bml — read another runtime against the bands this body keeps.
// stdin: {"fkwu":"./fkwu","match":"door-options","deadline_s":1800}
// fkwu is required; match is an ERE on band paths; deadline_s is positive seconds,
// defaulting to the sweep's ceiling. Every selected workload runs by argv as a child.
// Prints path, reading, pin, exit and class for each band, then the summary, exit 0.
// Short, stopped and deadline readings are outcomes, not errors of this door.
// Malformed/unknown/duplicate/wrong-kind options, missing/non-executable fkwu,
// invalid deadline or regex, and a match selecting no band are named refusals, exit 1.
// preflight-exec: forbidden
// preludes: form-stdlib/bml/stdin-source.bml form-stdlib/bml/candidate-floor.bml
section [form.bml] {
 cfl-request(cfl-doc(stdin-text()));
}
